    "summary": "Uses open-weights models only. DeepSeek V4.1 Flash is the only one on the board, so every role runs on it, judgment included, and the panel seats three of its effort levels. Max effort leaves the single-seat roles because the Droid run measured it resolving fewer tasks than high on more than twice the credits.",
